stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Loading
    Loading --> MainMenu : SaveGame carregado (UC07)

    MainMenu --> FreePlay : selecionar Free Play (UC01)
    MainMenu --> SongSelect : selecionar Song Select
    MainMenu --> Settings

    FreePlay --> MainMenu : ESC

    SongSelect --> SongSelect : navegar / selecionar dificuldade (UC08)
    SongSelect --> ChartLoading : confirmar (UC04)
    SongSelect --> MainMenu : ESC

    ChartLoading --> Playing : Chart pronto (cache ou gerado)

    Playing --> Paused : pausar (RF19)
    Paused --> Playing : retomar
    Paused --> SongSelect : abandonar (sem salvar score)

    Playing --> Results : peça concluída
    Results --> SaveProgress : salvar (UC06)
    SaveProgress --> SongSelect
    Results --> SongSelect : sem salvar (fluxo raro/erro)

    Settings --> MainMenu
